msgid "This site sets a cookie named myotp_pv_sid for one day to tie your verification to your browser. It keeps a record of the number, the code reference and the number of attempts for as long as the code is valid (the site setting, at most 4 hours), and after five wrong codes a 15-minute cooldown for your browser on that number. A verified number stays attached to your session for up to 30 minutes. Expired records are removed by a daily clean-up."
msgstr ""

